    "ETag": "Tkl3PaVZSvs7XvNX_LqZpL6yGHE",
    "Id": "UEwxemdOQ29XdF83YTc3eElnYndDcFpuTjhseG51ejVRWS4wOTA3OTZBNzVEMTUzOTMy",
    "Kind": "youtube#playlistItem",
    "Snippet": {
      "ChannelId": "UCiZeuI-7OPs7TmMel6Q5Msw",
      "ChannelTitle": "Kanishk Nishar",
      "Description": "Today I found a long-time-mislaid cassette containing this performance of Claudio Abbado conducting the LSO in Beethoven\u0027s seventh symphony, as part of their 1984 Royal Festival Hall Beethoven cycle. Included with it was a clip from the Sunday Times concert review: \u0027With playing as fine as this, any fears that the music may be over-familiar, disappear...\u0027\n\n1. Poco sostenuto \u2013 vivace 0:00\n2. Allegretto 21:11\n3. Presto \u2013 Assai meno presto 20:57\n4. Allegro con brio 28:19\n\nThis channel is not associated in any way with the London Symphony Orchestra, or its own CD label, LSO LIVE. These are off-air audio recordings made by LSO fans over a period of some 70 years, and are not rips of LSO LIVE recordings or streamed transmissions. We have greatly enjoyed these performances over the years - all of which were at least four years old at the time of posting - and just wish to share them with other music lovers for the pleasure of listening to the LSO in live performances. No copyright infringement is intended; please make contact if there is an issue.",
      "PlaylistId": "PL1zgNCoWt_7a77xIgbwCpZnN8lxnuz5QY",
      "Position": 14,
      "PublishedAtRaw": "2025-08-03T04:23:38Z",
